name: alt alignment;
%%
A<alt>this is the default alignment</alt>(fg) B<alt-l>this text is forced left</alt-l>(fg) C<alt-c>this text is forced center</alt-c>(fg) D<alt-r>this text is forced right</alt-r>(fg)
E(fg[alt:this is the default alignment]) F(fg[alt-l:this text is forced left]) G(fg[alt-c:this text is forced center]) H(fg[alt-r:this text is forced right]) (::)
